sequenceDiagram
    participant MD as marketdata
    participant BUS as BUS
    participant M as model
    participant BK as book
    participant R as recorder

    MD->>BUS: publish market.depth (TTL drop)
    BUS->>M: latest state (no backlog)
    M->>M: compute number
    M->>BUS: publish model.decision (TTL 5m)
    BUS->>BK: decision
    BK->>BK: record + confirm pattern
    BK->>BUS: publish model.fill
    BUS->>R: record everything once
